{
"#name"
:
{
"gitmirror"
:
null
,
"cn"
:
"在 git host 之间镜像仓库"
,
"en"
:
"Mirror git repositories between providers"
}
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"在 git host 之间镜像仓库"
,
"en"
:
"Mirror git repositories between providers"
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"数据布局与 x repo 完全一致 —— gitmirror 不存自己的本地状态。bare clone 落在\n$___X_CMD_REPO_ROOT/.bare/<provider>/<owner>/<name>.git（默认 ~/.x-repo/.bare/...），\n由 `x repo barefetch` 提供。这样 x repo 和 x gitmirror 共享同一份 bare 缓存：\n第一次 mirror 拉下来后，后续无论哪个工具调用都复用同一份数据，磁盘零冗余。\n"
,
"en"
:
"Data layout is shared with x repo — gitmirror stores nothing of its own.\nBare clones live at $___X_CMD_REPO_ROOT/.bare/<provider>/<owner>/<name>.git\n(default ~/.x-repo/.bare/...), provided by `x repo barefetch`. This way\nx repo and x gitmirror share the same bare cache: once a mirror fetches\na repo, every subsequent call (from either tool) reuses the same data —\nzero on-disk duplication.\n"
}
]
,
"#synopsis"
:
[
"x gitmirror sync [options] <src> <target>..."
]
,
"#subcmd:common"
:
[
"sync"
,
"run"
,
"apply"
]
,
"sync"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"把 <src> 推到一个或多个 <target>"
,
"en"
:
"Mirror <src> to one or more <target> urls (or remote names)"
}
,
"-n"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"并发上限（默认 1 串行）"
,
"en"
:
"Concurrency cap (default 1 = serial)"
}
}
,
"--pipe"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"从 stdin 读：每行一个 source（空格分隔 target）"
,
"en"
:
"Read from stdin: one source per line (space-separated targets)"
}
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"仓库 id 或 ssh URL（如 git@github.com:x-bash/repo）"
,
"en"
:
"Repo id or ssh URL (e.g. git@github.com:x-bash/repo)"
}
}
,
"<2>..."
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"目标 URL / 远端名（按顺序应用到 <src>）"
,
"en"
:
"Target url / remote name (applied to <src> in order)"
}
}
,
"-h"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"查看 sync 帮助"
,
"en"
:
"Show sync help"
}
}
}
,
"run"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"从 stdin 读 TSV（每行 <src>\\t<target>\\t...），dispatch 到 sync"
,
"en"
:
"Read TSV from stdin (each row <src>\\t<target>\\t...), dispatch to sync"
}
,
"-n"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"并发上限（默认 1 串行；走 failfast job pool）"
,
"en"
:
"Concurrency cap (default 1 = serial; uses failfast job pool)"
}
}
,
"-h"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"查看 run 帮助"
,
"en"
:
"Show run help"
}
}
}
,
"apply"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"从 yml 配置批量执行 mirror 任务"
,
"en"
:
"Batch-run mirror jobs from a yml spec"
}
,
"-n"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"并发上限（默认 1 串行；走 failfast job pool）"
,
"en"
:
"Concurrency cap (default 1 = serial; uses failfast job pool)"
}
}
,
"<1>..."
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"yml 配置文件路径；不传或 `-` 从 stdin 读"
,
"en"
:
"Path to a yml spec file; omit or pass `-` to read stdin"
}
}
,
"-h"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"查看 apply 帮助"
,
"en"
:
"Show apply help"
}
}
}
}

